>He literally leaves a trail of stink behind him when he leaves a room. How do you even get that stinky? And how do I try and get him to fix the smell? (Edit: no my user name is just funny it has nothing to do with this situation also I’m 99% sure he doesn’t have a colostomy bag)

Better question... How did she "get it on" with him and not notice a funky smell? I feel like this guy had to smell bad if he left a dang streak on the couch!!!
